  <names>
    <name lang="en">MDT EZ-0320.01 - Clear approximate front</name>
    <name lang="de">MDT EZ-0320.01 - Clear angenaeherte Front</name>
  </names>
  <informations>Unofficial simplified front illustration redrawn from official MDT photograph https://www.mdt.de/fileadmin/user_upload/_processed_/d/0/csm_EZ-0320-01_F_f526192c3d.png. Clear native regular Arial text, not pixel-traced lettering. This is an approximate layout, not a dimensionally/detail-exact manufacturer CAD conversion; pin details omitted. Front nominal envelope 72 x 90 mm, 2 drawing units/mm. No electrical connection terminals. Product source: https://www.mdt.de/produkte/produktdetail/aktorik/energiezaehler/energiezaehler-ez-mit-direktmessung.html</informations>
